      "orig": "3.1 This Agreement has an initial term of 24 months. It renews automatically for successive periods of 12 months, unless terminated. 3.2 Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice of at least 90 days before the end of the current term. 3.3 The Supplier may suspend the services if an invoice is more than 45 days overdue.",
